  "method": [
    "The hosted flat plane uses one metre of fog with log(2) optical depth and half-radiance ambient. The resolved RGB is three quarters of opaque RGB. The existing internal SDK probe measures the composition mask at stationary interior pixels.",
    "Authored controls keep projection and geometry fixed and compare opaque data, fog/SSR RGB, and output UI. Relocated replay archives are compared with headless Native AOT saves in fresh processes.",
    "The shared capture guide documents raw and resolved coordinates and the active composition payload. Device validation checks run under the Khronos Vulkan layer."
  ],
  "limits": "Qualification covers analytic and authored fixture composition. Moving-image quality, render performance, textured particle reconstruction and other temporal reconstruction backends remain separate."
}
